{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider1.png?t=1739883159\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact using your tools to investigate the evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interview select characters to gather crucial information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consult your trusty fae encyclopedia to uncover secrets of the faerie world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genderless protagonist with a customizable name.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between rekindling your past romance with the detective (M), indulging in the mature charm of your patron (M), nurturing a gothic romance with the assistant (F), straying your childhood friend (F) into an intoxicating love, or simply being contented with yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various different endings and epilogues shaped by the choices you made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider3.png?t=1739883159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a renowned faeologist in 1920s New York who has\u00a0been tasked with solving a chilling crime:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Bizarre murders happening across the upper echelons of New York society, with the mystery deepening with every clue.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the clues with your fae expertise and keen investigative tools such as a magnifying glass and a blacklight, and gather vital information by interviewing those who hold fragments of the truth, all while navigating your allegiance between a relentless detective and your enigmatic patron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you unravel the truth and cement the importance of faeology in a world that relegates it to the realm of pseudoscience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider4.png?t=1739883159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/introduction1b.png?t=1739883159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369020?t=1739883159","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739883159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/85f5685ea6f533df952e1c2e851e35458a9a885e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739883159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/85f5685ea6f533df952e1c2e851e35458a9a885e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739883159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider1.png?t=1739883159\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact using your tools to investigate the evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interview select characters to gather crucial information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consult your trusty fae encyclopedia to uncover secrets of the faerie world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genderless protagonist with a customizable name.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between rekindling your past romance with the detective (M), indulging in the mature charm of your patron (M), nurturing a gothic romance with the assistant (F), straying your childhood friend (F) into an intoxicating love, or simply being contented with yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various different endings and epilogues shaped by the choices you made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider3.png?t=1739883159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a renowned faeologist in 1920s New York who has\u00a0been tasked with solving a chilling crime:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Bizarre murders happening across the upper echelons of New York society, with the mystery deepening with every clue.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the clues with your fae expertise and keen investigative tools such as a magnifying glass and a blacklight, and gather vital information by interviewing those who hold fragments of the truth, all while navigating your allegiance between a relentless detective and your enigmatic patron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you unravel the truth and cement the importance of faeology in a world that relegates it to the realm of pseudoscience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider4.png?t=1739883159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/introduction1b.png?t=1739883159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Mushroomallow"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/header.jpg?t=1739883159",